o keep up with. Embracing the process of discovery without the burden of expectation can lead to a much more fulfilling experience, where you can savor each new sound pattern at your own pace and truly appreciate what resonates with you personally."], "document_offset": 0, "logical_document_count": 2, "physical_batch_limit": 4, "score_contract": "pointwise", "score_space": "unit_interval", "sequence": 996, "elapsed_seconds": 102.76827716827393}
