ress emotions that words alone often fail to capture. \", \"raw_text_hash\": \"0273aee06a4f88db3e70585717f79f993f879589f854ee93d87eda70c828e9de\", \"event_time\": null}], \"node_ids\": [\"past_music_experiences\"], \"raw_text_hash\": \"0273aee06a4f88db3e70585717f79f993f879589f854ee93d87eda70c828e9de\", \"source_role\": \"user\", \"source_message_indices\": [43], \"premise_group_ids\": [\"prem_3631c3415a3cb4cd805b9990\", \"prem_b50cf609562c938a501fadad\", \"prem_bfd3d02b5c5e678e96cc7bfc\"], \"time_fragments\": [], \"start\": 105, \"end\": 478, \"exact_quote\": \"User: I left feeling unsatisfied, as though the film skimmed over the intricacies that make music a universal language. It was almost as if they focused too much on celebrity interviews and not enough on the artistic process itself. I found myself reflecting on how music has the power to unite diverse cultures and express emotions that words alone often fail to capture. \"}, {\"node_id\": \"current_music_activities\", \"kind\": \"explicit\", \"stance\": \"support\", \"claim\": \"The user creates music for personal projects, connecting with their roots and exploring musical styles unique to their background.\", \"entity_scope\": \"user\", \"event_time\": null, \"reason\": \"The user states 'This has been great for my personal projects, allowing me to really connect with my roots as I create music. By diving into my heritage, I’ve been able to explore different musical styles that are unique to my background.'\", \"source_ids\": [\"src_69d3df27d8700e28605dd55c\"], \"time_source_ids\": [], \"doc_id\": \"personamem:memory:41148c9ced3a1407f0d3502173763c9a9dade44bf972aceedece4eac725d278d\", \"id\": \"e32\", \"assessment_id\": \"ev_3b979bee215df6fefca1dab2\", \"fragments\": [{\"source_role\": \"user\", \"source_message_indices\": [163], \"premise_group_ids\": [\"prem_a18b0c3918abd3e9f98cb55d\", \"prem_9daccb31f43385e72d17cde2\", \"prem_ee0a7ca549d9588c3d80b020\"], \"source_alias\": \"s31\", \"id\": \"src_69d3df27d87