ations. Each of these can rekindle your passion and allow for a fresh appreciation of the art form, helping you reconnect with what initially drew you to music in the first place.\n\nInformation needed:\n[{\"description\": \"How can I find a more fulfilling way to express my love for music?\", \"id\": \"answer\", \"time_scope\": null}, {\"description\": \"What are my personal goals or desires for expressing love for music?\", \"id\": \"subtask_music_goals\", \"time_scope\": null}]", "hits": [{"memory_id": "personamem:memory:aaffd3d364a21d460342e7babd8b5457280c15990c4562f7265fb84a3ced558a", "score": 0.6452089548110962, "rank": 0}, {"memory_id": "personamem:memory:096b8f38752f9b1202eecca12bd10b3a95cf64f1933be25dee5f842d3ea57707", "score": 0.6325415968894958, "rank": 1}, {"memory_id": "personamem:memory:191f200ba9683dc5f534f7869f085956e125fe3941835ea2a0a9ed7b755044e7", "score": 0.6219119429588318, "rank": 2}, {"memory_id": "personamem:memory:2cb1946568c5490c5a3ee4bdb9c2a51d2485f16543f002ab190bad74ea8b5fa1", "score": 0.6129500269889832, "rank": 3}], "candidate_ids": ["personamem:memory:aaffd3d364a21d460342e7babd8b5457280c15990c4562f7265fb84a3ced558a", "personamem:memory:096b8f38752f9b1202eecca12bd10b3a95cf64f1933be25dee5f842d3ea57707", "personamem:memory:191f200ba9683dc5f534f7869f085956e125fe3941835ea2a0a9ed7b755044e7", "personamem:memory:2cb1946568c5490c5a3ee4bdb9c2a51d2485f16543f002ab190bad74ea8b5fa1"], "proposed_count": 4, "target_id": null, "premise_ids": [], "source_memory_ids": ["personamem:memory:e7c973803319b0b032a23a834dfe4d7031c42cbaa315dba7d5243d255867dd55"], "domain_scope": "full_visible_bank", "excluded_ids": ["personamem:memory:e7c973803319b0b032a23a834dfe4d7031c42cbaa315dba7d5243d255867dd55"], "ann_call_index": 2, "stop_reason": null}, {"probe_id": "initial_bridge:00003", "stage": "initial_bridge", "probe_text": "Original overall question:\nHow can I find a more fulfilling way to express my love for music?\n\nCurrent retrieval task:\nWhat are my personal 